  "description": "UW-3b evaluation corpus: documents whose meaning is in their STRUCTURE (wrapped step tables, numbered rules with titles, checklists, fill-in forms), in PDF and markdown, across non-insurance domains. Measures that procedures become ordered steps, rules and checklist items become constraints with the right modality, and form prompts and table cells are never misread as rules or stitched into names. The insurance fixtures are measured by vertical-fixtures and must not regress.",
